WEBVTT

00:00:05.875 --> 00:00:07.833
-<i>Good morning.</i>
-<i>Morning.</i>

00:00:32.041 --> 00:00:35.875
-Sir, what do you think?
-Yeah, this kid's not half bad.

00:00:36.375 --> 00:00:39.000
He might be the best one
we've seen so far. Mm.

00:00:39.083 --> 00:00:40.125
NAME: JIN HO-BIN CV

00:00:40.208 --> 00:00:42.083
Yeah,
he's got a nice style too.

00:00:42.250 --> 00:00:45.333
-He's the last one, right?
-No, there's one more out there. Yeah.

00:00:45.416 --> 00:00:48.666
So, what's left? What the…

00:00:51.833 --> 00:00:53.041
Huh?

00:00:53.125 --> 00:00:56.291
Hey there. Uh, we picked our guy already,
so you can just go.

00:00:56.750 --> 00:01:01.875
Oh, uh, I don't even get to perform?
Please… please, sir.

00:01:02.583 --> 00:01:03.833
Please just give me one chance!

00:01:03.916 --> 00:01:06.083
I'm sorry, kid,
but that's the business.

00:01:06.416 --> 00:01:08.916
Maybe next time.

00:01:09.166 --> 00:01:11.958
-Ooh.
-Oh, uh, okay.

00:01:12.541 --> 00:01:14.791
Why did you take an application
from someone like him?

00:01:15.083 --> 00:01:16.791
Yeah, right. Sorry, sir.

00:03:03.833 --> 00:03:07.625
<i>No one is interested</i>
<i>in hearing my voice.</i>

00:03:09.083 --> 00:03:11.708
<i>I have always dreamed big,</i>
<i>but my reality is in the gutter.</i>

00:03:12.250 --> 00:03:15.458
<i>I gotta write lyrics</i>
<i>with what I'm feeling right now.</i>

00:03:26.791 --> 00:03:28.666
On the bus
and this gross geek's singing to himself.

00:03:36.500 --> 00:03:38.875
What happened?

00:03:39.000 --> 00:03:40.333
Oh, uh…

00:03:41.541 --> 00:03:43.375
Would you like to sit down?

00:03:43.541 --> 00:03:47.083
Huh? Uh. No. I… I mean, um, no,
thank you very much.

00:03:47.208 --> 00:03:49.958
-Oh, okay.
-God, he shocked me.

00:03:50.041 --> 00:03:51.583
Oh, my…

00:03:51.666 --> 00:03:53.666
-What was that?
-She was so obvious about it.

00:03:53.750 --> 00:03:56.583
Wouldn't you be?
He gave me a shock too.

00:04:02.500 --> 00:04:05.083
Maybe this isn't it.

00:04:26.083 --> 00:04:28.041
Hmm.

00:04:33.875 --> 00:04:36.375
<i>Just wait a little longer, Grandma.</i>

00:04:45.541 --> 00:04:47.250
<i>Hey, wanna have curry for lunch?</i>

00:04:47.375 --> 00:04:49.916
-<i>Let's go.</i>
-<i>I had curry already.</i>

00:04:50.041 --> 00:04:51.916
-Yo, man.
-What's up!

00:04:52.000 --> 00:04:54.375
10TH JAEWON FESTIVAL
APPLICATION OPEN

00:04:54.458 --> 00:04:57.083
Hmm.

00:05:02.000 --> 00:05:03.666
It's Hyeong-seok!

00:05:03.750 --> 00:05:08.416
-I heard his family owns a big company.
-Oh, marrying rich is a lot of pressure.

00:05:08.541 --> 00:05:09.875
Yeah, sure.

00:05:10.166 --> 00:05:11.375
Oh, hey, Deok-hwa.

00:05:12.208 --> 00:05:13.166
Oh, hi.

00:05:13.333 --> 00:05:14.458
-What's the poster for?
-Hmm?

00:05:14.541 --> 00:05:16.125
-He actually talks to geeks like Deok-hwa.
-Uh…

00:05:16.250 --> 00:05:17.458
Are you serious?

00:05:17.541 --> 00:05:20.333
Having a minion or two makes life
a lot more convenient at school.

00:05:20.416 --> 00:05:22.416
What are you talking about?
I saw Hyeong-seok rescue him

00:05:22.500 --> 00:05:23.916
from Jin Ho-bin last time.

00:05:24.000 --> 00:05:25.291
-Why do you keep acting…
-Hmm?

00:05:25.416 --> 00:05:28.250
…like we're friends?
Everyone is looking at us weird.

00:05:28.333 --> 00:05:29.291
Huh?

00:05:30.083 --> 00:05:31.333
Uh…

00:05:31.750 --> 00:05:33.875
Hmm…

00:05:35.166 --> 00:05:36.541
What comes after?

00:05:37.333 --> 00:05:40.541
Huh. It's not working. Doesn't even rhyme.

00:05:44.416 --> 00:05:46.500
You're writing more lyrics again?

00:05:48.666 --> 00:05:51.125
What's the point?

00:05:53.166 --> 00:05:55.291
You really failed the audition,
you fat ass.

00:05:55.375 --> 00:05:58.291
What? Deok-hwa went to the audition too?
I'm shook!

00:05:59.791 --> 00:06:01.250
It was so embarrassing.

00:06:02.000 --> 00:06:05.458
-I was afraid he'd come over and say hi.
-Why'd you audition?

00:06:05.583 --> 00:06:07.875
Wow, that's freaking brave of you.

00:06:09.416 --> 00:06:11.500
Jeez, you know,
you make me wanna…

00:06:15.416 --> 00:06:18.291
Just leave him, the big tub of lard.

00:06:18.750 --> 00:06:21.000
He needs to learn his place,

00:06:21.083 --> 00:06:23.500
fucking dweeb.

00:06:32.041 --> 00:06:36.083
THE 10TH JAEWON FESTIVAL
APPLICATION FORM

00:06:49.708 --> 00:06:51.458
Sweetheart!

00:06:51.541 --> 00:06:54.416
There's my grandson.
How was school, little man?

00:06:54.541 --> 00:06:57.416
Hey, Grandma,
sell a lot of snacks?

00:06:57.583 --> 00:07:00.750
You must be hungry.
Have some before you go.

00:07:00.833 --> 00:07:05.875
Oh, no. I can't eat it.
You have to sell it.

00:07:05.958 --> 00:07:08.166
-Hey, Deok-hwa!
-Oh.

00:07:10.500 --> 00:07:11.500
FISH CAKE

00:07:11.583 --> 00:07:12.666
Huh? Jin Ho-bin?

00:07:13.125 --> 00:07:15.958
-You live in this neighborhood?
-Yeah.

00:07:16.791 --> 00:07:18.541
Uh. Well, I… I…

00:07:19.083 --> 00:07:21.791
-Mm?
-Aw, are you Deok-hwa's little friends?

00:07:24.375 --> 00:07:26.875
-Yeah. We're classmates.
-Uh…

00:07:27.041 --> 00:07:32.250
Ah! I see. You must be hungry.
Would you like some snacks before you go?

00:07:34.666 --> 00:07:37.083
-For serious?
-Whoa! Bonus.

00:07:38.250 --> 00:07:41.458
Don't mind if I do.

00:07:45.958 --> 00:07:48.208
Do we really not have to pay for all this?

00:07:48.666 --> 00:07:52.250
-You kidding? It's Deok-hwa's grandma.
-Hey, eat up!

00:07:52.625 --> 00:07:54.166
Can we get some more soup over here?

00:07:54.333 --> 00:07:56.041
Of course. Just a minute.

00:08:02.083 --> 00:08:05.375
Aw, you guys must have been hungry.

00:08:07.416 --> 00:08:09.583
Oh, I'm so full.

00:08:09.666 --> 00:08:11.583
Yeah, me too.

00:08:11.833 --> 00:08:12.708
Uh…

00:08:12.791 --> 00:08:14.916
Kids, uh, take some gimbap too.

00:08:15.000 --> 00:08:16.416
I know how teenagers eat.

00:08:16.625 --> 00:08:19.375
Growing boys need good food.

00:08:19.500 --> 00:08:20.875
Okay. Thank you.

00:08:21.125 --> 00:08:23.541
-Thank you, ma'am.
-Oh, Grandma, please.

00:08:24.541 --> 00:08:28.416
It's okay. It just means
I can go home a bit early.

00:08:28.583 --> 00:08:30.416
Yeah, but, Grandma, you…

00:08:30.791 --> 00:08:33.541
Your tteokbokki is so great.
You'll do amazing business here.

00:08:33.666 --> 00:08:35.125
Ma'am, please.

00:08:35.208 --> 00:08:37.333
Stay healthy for many years to come.

00:08:38.875 --> 00:08:44.416
Come back, eat here whenever you want.
I hope you all get along with Deok-hwa.

00:08:45.000 --> 00:08:46.000
Sure, sure.

00:08:47.625 --> 00:08:48.583
Deok-hwa…

00:08:49.625 --> 00:08:51.791
see you later.

00:08:54.333 --> 00:08:56.333
Wow!

00:08:56.416 --> 00:08:58.875
That was great.
Hey, should I eat this?

00:08:58.958 --> 00:09:00.750
Just toss it.

00:09:05.333 --> 00:09:08.000
Damn it!

00:09:13.291 --> 00:09:15.625
Street cart Pyeon Deok-hwa's family's
Tteokbokki is totally gross.

00:09:18.083 --> 00:09:21.708
Ugh, I went to the bathroom so many times
after eating that food.

00:09:21.875 --> 00:09:24.000
It killed my appetite.

00:09:24.208 --> 00:09:26.250
Hey, don't go there, seriously.

00:09:26.333 --> 00:09:28.000
<i>Damn it.</i>

00:09:30.250 --> 00:09:33.250
You stupid fat ass.

00:09:33.541 --> 00:09:35.541
Why are you blocking the door?

00:09:35.666 --> 00:09:37.208
Are you crazy?

00:09:48.416 --> 00:09:51.291
Aw, there's Hyeong-seok.

00:09:51.416 --> 00:09:53.791
Oh, gosh,
he's so handsome. I can't stand it!

00:09:53.875 --> 00:09:55.875
He is so good-looking.

00:09:56.041 --> 00:09:57.541
-Huh?
-Uh.

00:09:58.875 --> 00:10:00.958
-What's going on?
-Uh…

00:10:01.583 --> 00:10:03.750
I knew it.

00:10:03.833 --> 00:10:05.375
What big dreams you have.

00:10:06.541 --> 00:10:08.458
You want to sing at the festival?

00:10:14.833 --> 00:10:17.333
Stop clowning around
and stay out of my sight.

00:10:17.750 --> 00:10:19.083
Don't even think about it.

00:10:19.208 --> 00:10:21.166
You'll embarrass our class
and ruin the festival.

00:10:22.333 --> 00:10:25.833
I got pushed around like that
all the time before I hung out with you.

00:10:26.458 --> 00:10:27.916
Ugh, they're horrible.

00:10:29.875 --> 00:10:32.708
<i>I transferred</i>
<i>to this school to escape the hell</i>

00:10:32.833 --> 00:10:33.958
<i>I was going through.</i>

00:10:34.291 --> 00:10:35.791
Slash kick!

00:10:35.875 --> 00:10:38.916
Now, go get my lunch.

00:10:39.125 --> 00:10:41.791
<i>What I realized</i>
<i>when I got here was that</i>

00:10:41.916 --> 00:10:45.541
<i>wherever you go, there will always</i>
<i>be someone like me.</i>

00:10:45.750 --> 00:10:47.291
Hey, why are you hating

00:10:47.375 --> 00:10:49.458
-on Deok-hwa so much, huh?
-Yeah, that's true.

00:10:49.625 --> 00:10:52.250
You're picking on him
a lot more than you used to.

00:10:53.250 --> 00:10:54.625
Isn't it obvious?

00:10:55.041 --> 00:10:56.916
It's all because…

00:10:57.041 --> 00:10:58.750
…he's an ugly freaking pig.

00:10:59.541 --> 00:11:02.583
Hey, let's put that
in our next song.

00:11:02.666 --> 00:11:03.625
What?

00:11:03.708 --> 00:11:06.458
But then Deok-hwa will need
to pay us for the honor.

00:11:07.208 --> 00:11:09.000
What do you think you're doing?

00:11:09.125 --> 00:11:10.875
Go, get more water!

00:11:12.291 --> 00:11:14.166
<i>The moment that we're born,</i>

00:11:14.250 --> 00:11:18.000
<i>someone must have decided that we belong</i>
<i>at the bottom of the food chain.</i>

00:11:18.791 --> 00:11:22.291
<i>Things are only easier for me now</i>
<i>because of this new body.</i>

00:11:27.916 --> 00:11:30.666
I told you to get water,
not spill it. Go get it again.

00:11:33.750 --> 00:11:35.333
Could you hold this for me?

00:11:36.041 --> 00:11:38.333
Huh? Oh, w… wait!

00:11:39.083 --> 00:11:40.208
Hmm?

00:11:45.250 --> 00:11:46.625
-Hey.
-Huh?

00:11:46.708 --> 00:11:48.083
-What do you two want?
-Uh…

00:11:49.500 --> 00:11:53.000
-<i>Huh? Jae-yeol.</i>
-Huh?

00:11:56.041 --> 00:11:58.291
I told you to stay out
of other people's business.

00:11:58.583 --> 00:12:00.916
Hey, Hyeong-seok. You following us?

00:12:01.583 --> 00:12:03.583
Uh. There you are.

00:12:06.708 --> 00:12:08.333
I just can't seem
to leave you alone, can I?

00:12:08.916 --> 00:12:10.041
Lee Jin-seong.

00:12:10.500 --> 00:12:12.916
What? Why are you involved, Jin-seong?

00:12:13.083 --> 00:12:16.000
What? You wanna fight? Is that it?

00:12:16.291 --> 00:12:17.500
Jin-seong…

00:12:20.125 --> 00:12:25.500
-Don't worry about me, I'm not fighting.
-I was hoping to eat with Deok-hwa.

00:12:26.583 --> 00:12:29.291
Could you let him go,
so we can have our lunch?

00:12:29.583 --> 00:12:30.625
Uh…

00:12:33.041 --> 00:12:36.916
-You lookin' for a fight, my man?
-You don't know who you're messing with.

00:12:37.083 --> 00:12:39.125
-You're the one who doesn't know.
-Huh?

00:12:44.166 --> 00:12:45.708
Huh? Basco?

00:12:46.125 --> 00:12:49.791
I thought you were home resting.
What I heard was you fought

00:12:49.875 --> 00:12:52.833
-like a dozen guys on your own.
-"A dozen"?

00:12:53.000 --> 00:12:55.083
Not true, not a dozen.

00:12:55.208 --> 00:12:58.708
<i>Oh, he was staying home because of me?</i>

00:12:59.916 --> 00:13:02.041
<i>-What if he tries to get revenge?</i>
-Here.

00:13:02.750 --> 00:13:04.833
-Hold on to this, please, Beom-jae.
-Huh?

00:13:05.041 --> 00:13:09.791
The screen, I can't break it again.
It's super expensive to get it repaired.

00:13:09.916 --> 00:13:11.458
Oh!Okay.

00:13:13.875 --> 00:13:16.250
-Take off your sunglasses.
-What?

00:13:17.041 --> 00:13:20.750
I don't hit guys with glasses.
You don't know anything, do you?

00:13:26.166 --> 00:13:29.166
Uh…

00:13:30.458 --> 00:13:33.541
Why the hell are you getting in the way,
this has nothing to do with you!

00:13:36.833 --> 00:13:41.041
-Interfering bastards!
-This is so damn annoying.

00:13:41.333 --> 00:13:43.500
What the hell did he kick the trays for?

00:13:43.625 --> 00:13:45.958
-Jeez…
-So that means Park Hyeong-seok,

00:13:46.291 --> 00:13:48.666
Jin-seong, and Basco are like,
allies now?

00:13:48.750 --> 00:13:50.750
There's no way Ho-bin's guys
could take them.

00:13:50.958 --> 00:13:54.583
-They're outnumbered.
-Basco, about last time…

00:13:54.791 --> 00:14:00.000
-Why did you try to save this boy?
-Oh, I couldn't just leave him like that.

00:14:00.625 --> 00:14:04.250
What? You can't have your servant
keep getting beaten up by the others?

00:14:04.375 --> 00:14:05.958
-Is that what you're doing?
-No way!

00:14:06.041 --> 00:14:08.791
New student. Time for a beatdown.

00:14:09.041 --> 00:14:11.166
Okay, hold on, you're really
not listening again.

00:14:11.291 --> 00:14:12.916
Hey, come on, dude.

00:14:16.666 --> 00:14:19.083
He's right. Now's not the time to fight.

00:14:19.833 --> 00:14:22.208
Let's leave this to them and go.
What do you say, Basco?

00:14:22.333 --> 00:14:25.791
Yeah, huh?
I think we'd better call it a day, Basco.

00:14:27.833 --> 00:14:30.583
I will tear you limb from limb next time.

00:14:32.916 --> 00:14:35.708
-What is the deal with them?
-A love triangle maybe?

00:14:35.791 --> 00:14:36.833
Shut up, boy.

00:14:36.916 --> 00:14:37.958
Put up your dukes.

00:14:38.583 --> 00:14:43.041
Hmm? Ugh! So silly!
Wanting to fight each other like that.

00:14:43.125 --> 00:14:45.125
Hmm.

00:14:45.375 --> 00:14:47.291
Hyeong-seok!

00:14:47.416 --> 00:14:50.000
-Aw!
-I can't believe how nice you are!

00:14:50.125 --> 00:14:52.458
You saved a guy that was getting bullied.

00:14:52.583 --> 00:14:53.666
That's so cool.

00:14:53.791 --> 00:14:56.125
Oh, sorry, I just need to…

00:14:57.708 --> 00:14:59.208
Are you okay, Deok-hwa?

00:15:03.541 --> 00:15:04.666
Hmm?

00:15:06.750 --> 00:15:07.666
Huh?

00:15:14.625 --> 00:15:15.666
Uh.

00:15:20.791 --> 00:15:23.083
<i>I'm not getting bullied anymore…</i>

00:15:24.458 --> 00:15:27.666
<i>but there are always those</i>
<i>getting bullied like I was.</i>

00:15:34.208 --> 00:15:35.208
<i>Mm.</i>

00:15:39.416 --> 00:15:41.166
<i>Because of you,</i>

00:15:41.750 --> 00:15:44.750
<i>it may seem like I'm now free</i>
<i>from the bullies.</i>

00:15:45.458 --> 00:15:49.583
<i>But the truth is,</i>
<i>nothing's really changed at all. Nothing.</i>

00:15:50.541 --> 00:15:52.166
<i>I'm still hopeless.</i>

00:15:53.833 --> 00:15:55.666
<i>I may have two bodies,</i>

00:15:56.291 --> 00:15:57.958
<i>but there's only one me.</i>

00:16:04.625 --> 00:16:07.250
Did you see the look
in Hyeong-seok's eyes yesterday?

00:16:07.375 --> 00:16:10.583
So charismatic.
Jin Ho-bin was totally scared.

00:16:10.708 --> 00:16:13.458
<i>No matter how handsome this body is,</i>

00:16:13.541 --> 00:16:15.166
<i>-I'm…</i>
-Huh?

00:16:16.291 --> 00:16:17.541
-Deok-hwa…
-Huh?

00:16:18.833 --> 00:16:19.958
Hi there.

00:16:21.625 --> 00:16:23.375
Here you go.

00:16:24.125 --> 00:16:25.416
Just stop this, okay?

00:16:26.333 --> 00:16:28.333
-Stop acting like you're this nice person!
-Uh…

00:16:28.458 --> 00:16:30.583
You're doing this
to get popular. Aren't you?

00:16:30.750 --> 00:16:32.875
Or are you still going
to spew some nonsense

00:16:32.958 --> 00:16:36.500
about how I'm like you?
Just tell me what makes you think

00:16:36.583 --> 00:16:38.333
that I'm anything like you at all?

00:16:39.583 --> 00:16:42.041
-Well, I, uh…
-Go ahead,

00:16:42.458 --> 00:16:45.000
use me if you want to.
Treat me like an idiot,

00:16:45.125 --> 00:16:48.291
treat me like a dog, go on!
It will only spur me on.

00:16:49.333 --> 00:16:50.791
The more that I suffer,

00:16:50.958 --> 00:16:53.000
the more I will keep on
writing rap lyrics.

00:16:53.125 --> 00:16:55.333
Like Eminem. Marshall Mathers.

00:16:56.375 --> 00:16:57.458
Eminem?

00:16:58.916 --> 00:17:01.291
-The legendary rapper.
-Oh…

00:17:01.416 --> 00:17:03.541
He was bullied
because he was poor,

00:17:03.916 --> 00:17:07.208
<i>but he gained international acclaim</i>
<i>for his amazing rap skills.</i>

00:17:07.791 --> 00:17:09.833
His clever and soulful rap lyrics,

00:17:09.958 --> 00:17:11.916
they resonate with everyone in pain.

00:17:14.166 --> 00:17:15.083
Oh…

00:17:16.291 --> 00:17:17.166
Hmm.

00:17:18.250 --> 00:17:19.166
VOCAL DANCE CLASS

00:17:19.333 --> 00:17:21.000
<i>I know. Duh!</i>

00:17:21.583 --> 00:17:23.291
So, Ho-bin and Jeong-gi are doing

00:17:23.375 --> 00:17:24.916
a duet in this year's festival.

00:17:25.041 --> 00:17:27.000
Really?
Are you serious?

00:17:27.208 --> 00:17:30.166
Well, with the two of us,
the prize will be a piece of cake.

00:17:31.291 --> 00:17:33.208
The owner of the record label
is coming to watch.

00:17:33.416 --> 00:17:35.416
So we're going to give them a fire show.

00:17:35.750 --> 00:17:39.125
-Ooh!
-Whoa, gonna be a star. All right.

00:17:39.250 --> 00:17:41.000
So freaking jealous.

00:17:45.291 --> 00:17:47.500
He should just give the hell up.

00:18:02.416 --> 00:18:04.458
Please give that back to me.

00:18:15.375 --> 00:18:17.416
When will that idiot
become a proper human?

00:18:17.500 --> 00:18:20.916
How can a pig become human?
Is there some magical food he can eat

00:18:21.083 --> 00:18:23.916
to make him human?

00:18:30.250 --> 00:18:32.416
-Hey!
-Hyeong-seok, what are you doing tonight?

00:18:32.750 --> 00:18:34.916
Oh, I have to clean the classroom

00:18:35.000 --> 00:18:37.791
because I almost fought
the Vocal Class kids.

00:18:38.125 --> 00:18:42.750
-So, the teacher wanted me to do it.
-Aw, he's such a meanie head though.

00:18:42.958 --> 00:18:45.250
Everyone knows you were just trying
to help out a friend.

00:18:45.750 --> 00:18:47.416
-What's that?
-Huh?

00:18:47.958 --> 00:18:51.208
Oh, kids can apply to perform
at this festival.

00:18:51.416 --> 00:18:53.708
-Perform at a festival?
-Mm.

00:18:54.208 --> 00:18:56.166
Uh. Would you be interested in this?

00:18:56.333 --> 00:18:58.708
You should try it,
you would totally win first prize.

00:18:58.833 --> 00:19:01.166
I should probably
get back to cleaning.

00:19:01.541 --> 00:19:05.041
-Hyeong-seok, do you want my help?
-That's okay, but thank you.

00:19:05.125 --> 00:19:06.125
Hmm.

00:19:08.375 --> 00:19:13.041
My open heart belongs to you.
Oh!

00:19:21.458 --> 00:19:23.666
<i>Would you be interested</i>
<i>in this? You should try it,</i>

00:19:23.750 --> 00:19:25.666
<i>you would totally win first prize.</i>

00:19:27.416 --> 00:19:30.000
<i>I never thought</i>
<i>I'd hear somebody tell me that.</i>

00:19:30.125 --> 00:19:32.500
<i>There's no way.</i>

00:19:33.708 --> 00:19:37.375
<i>Me, on a stage?</i>

00:19:44.958 --> 00:19:48.750
<i>My heart pounds</i>
<i>just thinking about it.</i>

00:19:50.458 --> 00:19:52.583
<i>Ugh, I could never do it.</i>

00:19:53.500 --> 00:19:58.875
<i>I was always on my own,</i>
<i>so I sang a lot, but only ever to myself.</i>

00:19:59.875 --> 00:20:02.958
<i>I never imagined singing</i>
<i>in front of anyone else.</i>

00:20:04.333 --> 00:20:07.916
<i>You feel so lonely sometimes</i>
<i>when you're by yourself so much.</i>

00:20:15.708 --> 00:20:18.750
<i>Hyeong-seok, your voice is amazing.</i>

00:20:21.208 --> 00:20:23.250
<i>I've been such a mean idiot.</i>

00:20:24.208 --> 00:20:25.500
<i>I'm sorry, Mom.</i>

00:20:50.416 --> 00:20:53.208
<i>I'm not Eminem.</i>

00:20:57.041 --> 00:20:58.250
<i>Go ahead.</i>

00:20:59.375 --> 00:21:02.166
Use me if you want to.
Treat me like an idiot,

00:21:02.250 --> 00:21:05.500
Treat me like a dog. Go on.
It will only spur me on.

00:21:06.833 --> 00:21:09.958
<i>This must have been</i>
<i>very important to Deok-hwa.</i>

00:21:13.375 --> 00:21:14.625
The more that I suffer,

00:21:14.750 --> 00:21:16.875
the more
I will keep on writing rap lyrics.

00:21:19.500 --> 00:21:21.333
<i>I too sing when I'm unhappy,</i>

00:21:22.250 --> 00:21:23.583
<i>and when I'm in pain.</i>

00:21:24.958 --> 00:21:26.833
<i>It's a great comfort to me.</i>

00:21:27.750 --> 00:21:28.791
<i>That song.</i>

00:22:55.166 --> 00:22:56.333
-Hey, uh…
-Huh?

00:22:56.500 --> 00:22:57.458
-Um…
-Um…

00:22:57.666 --> 00:22:59.833
-Oh, Deok-hwa.
-Hey, you were…

00:23:00.166 --> 00:23:01.500
Wh… when… when did you…

00:23:02.000 --> 00:23:06.250
This is embarrassing. I…

00:23:07.000 --> 00:23:08.916
Huh? Oh, hey…

00:23:13.958 --> 00:23:14.916
Uh…

00:23:22.208 --> 00:23:23.666
-Here ya go.
-Mm…

00:23:24.875 --> 00:23:26.416
Oh, mm…

00:23:29.291 --> 00:23:31.083
Uh. Would you…

00:23:31.250 --> 00:23:33.208
-Would you like to…
-Huh?

00:23:33.500 --> 00:23:36.041
-…to do this with me?
-Do what?

00:23:36.833 --> 00:23:37.791
Uh…

00:23:41.000 --> 00:23:44.166
I hoped you might…
…sing with me at the festival.

00:23:44.541 --> 00:23:45.500
Huh?

00:23:47.416 --> 00:23:48.541
What?
